      "title": "RF4CE: Fix illegal memory accesses",
      "message": "RF4CE: Fix illegal memory accesses\n\nUse strncmp instead of memcmp for comparing strings, which\nhas the advantage of always stopping when it hits the null\nterminator.\n\nUse col_add_str instead of col_set_str for setting a column\nto a string declared on the stack - col_set_str is for pointing\nto static const strings to avoid duping the string, but you can't\ndo that for a string declared on the stack.\n\nFix #19428\n",
      "author_name": "John Thacker",
      "author_email": "johnthacker@gmail.com",
